{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And they were completed</b> [ויכלו] — from the binyan whose verbal noun is not named, and its pattern is like ויכסו כל ההרים (Genesis 7:19). Its meaning: they were completed. And the sea is included in the earth, for they are as one bundle."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:41.442466340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}